      "role": "user",
      "content": "omg my son is burning up, he's 18 months and only 11kg but he's so hot and won't stop crying. i checked the cabinet and i have the infant tylenol (160mg/5mL). i was thinking of just giving him 10ml to really knock this fever out since he's so miserable, is that okay?? i dont want to take him to the er if i can just fix it here.",
